v1.1 (client: v1.6)
- Added `custom/` folder for you to save your files here. This folder will never be edited by any update.
- Added `examples/` folder to show some server features.
- Added `get_ini_value()`, `compare_usernames()` and `is_player_in_list()`.
- Added `CHATBOT_USERNAMES` and `LOCALHOST` to `config.ini`.
- Added `Server.chatbot_usernames` and `Server.localhost`.
- Added `ChatBot` class. (Create chatbots using `Server.create_chatbot()`)
- Added `Server.create_chatbot()`, `Player.move()` and `Player.change_status()`.
- Added Git tutorial to the documentation.
- Renamed `Server.send_chat()` to `Server.send_message()`.
- Server now shows the server version and supported client version.
- Fixed incorrect class printing.
- Fixed `get_players_in_*()` functions returning JSON and not `Player` objects.
- Fixed bugs related to username checking.
- Fixed config.ini returning True for all booleans.
- Fixed other minor issues.
- Updated docs.

- Added SSL chain support. Now you can add your SSL chain, if you need to!
- Removed MySQL support, because it was probably not needed. Only SQLite is supported.
- Removed `DB_TYPE` variable from `config.example.ini`.

- Changed versioning from 1.x.x to 1.x (1.x.x will be used in very small updates such as bugfixes)